# The paper corpus: ~1.1 GB of third-party PDFs and arXiv tarballs, re-downloadable
# and not this project's work.
Library/

# The knowledge graph. `Knowledge/kg/db` alone is 126 MB -- past GitHub's 100 MB per-file
# limit, so a push carrying it is refused -- and it is rebuilt from the YAML notes by
# `Knowledge/kg/build.py`.
Knowledge/

# Source material and session prompts. The deck is cited throughout the code as
# provenance ("ion_transport_deck_v3.pptx.pdf p.16") but is never opened by it, so the
# citations stand on their own; the prompts are working notes, not part of the platform.
/ion_transport_deck_v3.pptx.pdf
/qccd_latex_source_download_prompt.md
/docs/NEXT_SESSION_PROMPT.md
